Subject: [PATCH] web: update source-map-js for indexed source map DoS fix

Update the locked build-only dependency to 1.2.2. This prevents attacker
controlled indexed source map section offsets from blocking the build tool
runtime's event loop. Runtime camera images do not install node_modules.

CVE: CVE-2026-93749
Upstream-Status: Pending [firmware repository lockfile update]

diff --git a/web/package-lock.json b/web/package-lock.json
index 8ede60d..1528cc5 100644
--- a/web/package-lock.json
+++ b/web/package-lock.json
@@ -1973,10 +1973,11 @@
       "dev": true
     },
     "node_modules/source-map-js": {
-      "version": "1.2.1",
-      "resolved": "https://registry.npmjs.org/source-map-js/-/source-map-js-1.2.1.tgz",
-      "integrity": "sha512-UXWMKhLOwVKb728IUtQPXxfYU+usdybtUrK/8uGE8CQMvrhOpwvzDBwj0QhSL7MQc7vIsISBG8VQ8+IDQxpfQA==",
+      "version": "1.2.2",
